## 3. Schema 模型（自第 240 行起）

### 8. Schema 模型

引擎不应使用单一臃肿的 Schema 对象，而应使用顶层资源元对象：

```ts
type ResourceMeta = {
  resource: string;
  label: string;
  idKey: string;
  permissions?: ResourcePermissionMeta;
  api: ResourceApiMeta;
  metrics?: MetricsSchema;
  table: TableSchema;
  filters: FilterSchema;
  form: FormSchema;
  detail?: DetailSchema;
  actions?: ActionSchema[];
};
```

#### 8.1 API 元数据

```ts
type ResourceApiMeta = {
  list: string;
  detail: string;
  create: string;
  update: string;
  delete?: string;
  actions?: Record<string, string>;
  options?: Record<string, string>;
};
```

#### 8.2 表格 Schema

```ts
type TableSchema = {
  columns: TableColumnSchema[];
  rowKey?: string;
  selectable?: boolean;
  pagination?: boolean;
  defaultSort?: { field: string; order: "asc" | "desc" };
  rowActions?: ActionRef[];
  bulkActions?: ActionRef[];
};
```

```ts
type TableColumnSchema = {
  key: string;
  title: string;
  type?: string;
  width?: number | string;
  align?: "left" | "center" | "right";
  sortable?: boolean;
  fixed?: "left" | "right";
  visible?: boolean;
  permission?: string | string[];
  enum?: Array<{ label: string; value: any; tone?: string }>;
  slot?: string;
  formatter?: string;
};
```

列 `type` 示例：`text`、`number`、`date`、`datetime`、`currency`、`percent`、`status`、`tags`、`progress`、`user`、`relation`、`custom`。

#### 8.3 筛选 Schema

```ts
type FilterSchema = {
  fields: FilterFieldSchema[];
  primary?: string[];
  collapsible?: boolean;
};
```

```ts
type FilterFieldSchema = {
  key: string;
  label: string;
  component: string;
  field?: string;
  operator?: string;
  placeholder?: string;
  width?: number | string;
  defaultValue?: any;
  options?: Array<{ label: string; value: any }>;
  remote?: RemoteOptionMeta;
  permission?: string | string[];
};
```

筛选组件示例：`text`、`select`、`multiSelect`、`remoteSelect`、`dateRange`、`dateTimeRange`、`numberRange`、`statusSelect`、`userSelect`。

#### 8.4 表单 Schema

```ts
type FormSchema = {
  title?: string;
  width?: "sm" | "md" | "lg" | number;
  sections: FormSectionSchema[];
  actions: DrawerSubmitAction[];
};
```

```ts
type FormSectionSchema = {
  key: string;
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  fields: FormFieldSchema[];
};
```

```ts
type FormFieldSchema = {
  key: string;
  label: string;
  component: string;
  required?: boolean;
  readonly?: boolean;
  hidden?: boolean;
  placeholder?: string;
  description?: string;
  span?: 12 | 24;
  defaultValue?: any;
  options?: Array<{ label: string; value: any }>;
  remote?: RemoteOptionMeta;
  rules?: ValidationRuleMeta[];
  visibleWhen?: ConditionMeta[];
  disabledWhen?: ConditionMeta[];
  permission?: string | string[];
};
```

表单组件示例：`input`、`textarea`、`number`、`switch`、`radioGroup`、`checkboxGroup`、`select`、`combobox`、`dateTime`、`tags`、`remoteSelect`、`tableSelect`、`jsonEditor`、`codeEditor`。

#### 8.5 详情 Schema

```ts
type DetailSchema = {
  width?: "sm" | "md" | "lg" | number;
  sections: DetailSectionSchema[];
};
```

```ts
type DetailSectionSchema = {
  key: string;
  title?: string;
  fields: DetailFieldSchema[];
};
```

#### 8.6 操作 Schema

```ts
type ActionSchema = {
  key: string;
  label: string;
  kind: "drawer" | "request" | "danger" | "link";
  permission?: string | string[];
  visibleWhen?: ConditionMeta[];
  confirm?: {
    title: string;
    description?: string;
  };
  api?: string;
};
```

